   <narrative xml:lang="EN">219645_WFP_CLOSED_FY22_Sudan_Blue Nile State Food for Assets</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To save lives through improved nutrition status of children being boys and girls, pregnant and lactating women while restoring livelihoods and enhancing community resilience to shocks amongst the vulnerable Internally displaced persons, residents, returnees and refugees in South Darfur 
 
 Food For Assets 
 
 Gessani, Blue Nile State, South Darfur, Sudan 
 
 Activities will be IGA - basket weaving, soap making, vocational training, tech support , construction/rehabilitation of vocational training centres. adult literacy training,
 
 hand pump rehabilitation x 5. homestead garden , fuel efficient stoves, crop production training.</narrative>
  </description>
